erate scope narrowing beyond 'Files to Read'/'Task' as written, which itself needs sign-off given the explicit Prohibition 'Do not break existing tests'. Code changes (Code.gs healWeek_/healOrphanCandidates_, summary_audit.gs orphan sweep) are implemented and left in the working tree, uncommitted, for review alongside this note. Re-run `node connectors/gas/test_code.js` to reproduce (1445 passed, 1 failed).

